cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "TEMDD: Tested Event Model Driven Development als ausführbare Sprache und Effect-Verification-Laufzeit"
message: "If you use this declaration, please cite this publication."
type: article
authors:
  - family-names: Lohmann
    given-names: Ingolf
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-23"
license: "CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Goldkelch/qik-vrt"
url: "https://github.com/Goldkelch/qik-vrt/tree/main/docs/publications/2026-09-23-temdd-executable-language-runtime"
abstract: "Product-Owner architecture declaration defining Tested Event Model Driven Development (TEMDD) as an executable language with integrated development, debugging, testing, linking and effect-verification runtime. The completion semantics require COMPILE, BIND, RESOLVE, EXECUTE, TEST, OBSERVE, READBACK and ACCEPT before EFFECT_ACK_DONE."
keywords:
  - TEMDD
  - Tested Event Model Driven Development
  - executable language
  - effect verification
  - EFFECT_ACK
  - compiler
  - linker
  - debugger
  - test runtime
  - QIK-VRT
